And to be fair, I think that this one probably made them a ton of money because the license

00:51:25.800 --> 00:51:30.760
isn't easy to get either, but they probably sold, if I had to take a guess, in 1988 at

00:51:30.760 --> 00:51:32.560
least a million copies of this game.

00:51:33.060 --> 00:51:34.060
Maybe. Yeah.

00:51:34.060 --> 00:51:35.340
That seems a little high for me.

00:51:35.360 --> 00:51:38.860
Well, the reason why I say at least a million, and this is, you know, me doing some research,

00:51:38.980 --> 00:51:40.280
is because... Because you know it's over a million.

00:51:40.280 --> 00:51:45.820
No, I know that the Intellivision version of MLB sold over a million.

00:51:46.020 --> 00:51:48.400
So if anything, who knows, maybe they sold even better, you know?

00:51:49.020 --> 00:51:53.260
