00:51:53.420 --> 00:51:54.940
That's true. So anything can happen.

00:51:55.340 --> 00:51:57.960
I definitely think they made some money off of this.

00:51:58.120 --> 00:52:00.480
And, you know, we shit on LJN a lot.

00:52:00.480 --> 00:52:02.480
And it's worth recognizing when they do good.

